=== layout: section
# Genotypes Explained

=== layout: two-panels

# One segregating locus versus two

@left

## One locus: Mendel model

- Hold P fixed as PP
- CCPP x ccPP &rarr; CcPP
- Self CcPP
- 3 C\_PP : 1 ccPP
- [3 purple : 1 white]{color=purple}

@right

## Two loci: complementary genes

- CCpp x ccPP &rarr; CcPp
- Both white parents supply a missing step
- Self CcPp
- 9 C\_P\_ : 7 with cc or pp
- [9 purple : 7 white]{color=purple}

