- Y\_: green &rarr; yellow
- yy: second reaction blocked
- Work it out with your neighbors

@bottom

| Egg / pollen | WY | Wy | wY | wy |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| WY | WWYY | WWYy | WwYY | WwYy |
| Wy | WWYy | WWyy | WwYy | Wwyy |
| wY | WwYY | WwYy | wwYY | wwYy |
| wy | WwYy | Wwyy | wwYy | wwyy |

