=== layout: one-panel

# Common gene-interaction ratios

@body

| Interaction | F2 ratio | Example or model |
| --- | --- | --- |
| No epistasis | 9:3:3:1 | Pea seed shape/color |
| Recessive epistasis | 9:3:4 | Labrador coat color |
| Dominant epistasis | 12:3:1 | Summer squash |
| Duplicate recessive | 9:7 | Two required steps |
| Duplicate interaction | 9:6:1 | Two single-dominant classes merge |
| Duplicate dominant | 15:1 | Either dominant allele suffices |
| Dominant/recessive | 13:3 | Dominant suppression |

=== layout: one-panel

# Combine F2 classes with the same phenotype

@body

| Interaction | Group the 9, 3, 3, 1 classes | F2 ratio |
| --- | --- | --- |
| None | 9 : 3 : 3 : 1 | [9:3:3:1]{color=purple} |
| Recessive | 9 : 3 : [(3+1)]{color=blue} | [9:3:4]{color=purple} |
| Dominant | [(9+3)]{color=blue} : 3 : 1 | [12:3:1]{color=purple} |
| Duplicate recessive | 9 : [(3+3+1)]{color=blue} | [9:7]{color=purple} |
| Duplicate interaction | 9 : [(3+3)]{color=blue} : 1 | [9:6:1]{color=purple} |
| Duplicate dominant | [(9+3+3)]{color=blue} : 1 | [15:1]{color=purple} |
| Dominant/recessive | [(9+3+1)]{color=blue} : 3 | [13:3]{color=purple} |

