=== layout: two-panels

# Predict the testcross phenotype ratio

@left

## Given: F2 phenotypes are 9:7

| Genotype class | F2 count / 16 |
| --- | --- |
| [A\_B\_]{color=purple} | 9 |
| [A\_bb]{color=gray} | 3 |
| [aaB\_]{color=gray} | 3 |
| [aabb]{color=gray} | 1 |

@right

- A\_bb, aaB\_, aabb have the same phenotype
- Testcross: AaBb x aabb
- Four offspring genotypes, each equally likely
- [What is the phenotype ratio?]{color=red}

