# Same phenotype grouping; different cross

@body

## F2 class weights: 9, 3, 3, 1. Testcross class weights: 1, 1, 1, 1.

| Interaction | F2 phenotype ratio | Testcross phenotype ratio |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Duplicate recessive | [9:7]{color=purple} | [1:3]{color=green} |
| Dominant epistasis | [12:3:1]{color=purple} | [2:1:1]{color=green} |
| Duplicate interaction | [9:6:1]{color=purple} | [1:2:1]{color=green} |
| Recessive epistasis v1 | [9:3:4]{color=purple} | [1:1:2]{color=green} |
| Recessive epistasis v2 | [9:4:3]{color=purple} | [1:2:1]{color=green} |
| Duplicate dominant | [15:1]{color=purple} | [3:1]{color=green} |

