=== layout: one-panel

# Epistasis changes phenotypes, not segregation

@body

## Assume independently assorting loci and complete dominance within each locus.

| Example | F2 phenotype ratio | Testcross phenotype ratio |
| --- | --- | --- |
| No epistasis | 9:3:3:1 | [1:1:1:1]{color=green} |
| Summer squash | 12:3:1 | [2:1:1]{color=green} |
| Labrador retriever | 9:3:4 | [1:1:2]{color=green} |
| Pea flower color | 9:7 | [1:3]{color=green} |

