# Epistasis: a blocked step masks another gene

@left

## Upstream step blocked

![No starting material supplied to the color and drawing steps](assets/lect05h-epistasis/image_010.png)

No starting material: the color allele cannot affect the output.

@right

## Downstream step blocked

![Color made but the final drawing step fails](assets/lect05h-epistasis/image_011.png)

Color is made, but the final step cannot display it.

