=== layout: one-panel

# Summary: explain the phenotype ratio

@body

- Dominance: within a locus; epistasis: between loci
- Follow the pathway to predict each phenotype
- [Add probabilities]{color=blue} for the same phenotype
- Choose class weights for the actual cross

@notes

For independent loci, an AaBb by AaBb cross supplies class weights 9,3,3,1; an AaBb by aabb testcross supplies 1,1,1,1. The pathway determines which classes share a phenotype. Ask students to explain one grouping.

